# Context-exclusion policy for coding agents.
# Claude Code enforces the Read/Grep side of this via permissions.deny in
# .claude/settings.json (local, gitignored); this file is the committed,
# tool-agnostic statement of the same policy. If your tool honors
# .claudeignore natively, these patterns apply directly.
#
# Rule of thumb: NEVER pull bulk data into agent context. Inspect data with
# `python -c "import pandas as pd; print(pd.read_csv(p, nrows=5))"` instead.

# Bulk data (4.6 GB total)
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/research/xfp_cache/
data/research/espn_snapshot/
data/research/fa_snapshots/
*.parquet
*.pkl
*.bak

# Nested public deploy repo (522 MB; edit via refresh pipeline, not by hand)
xfp-model/

# Generated HTML dashboards (regenerate, don't read whole)
data/outputs/*.html
data/outputs/*.js

# Untracked one-off scratch files in the repo root
scratchpad_*
scratch_*

# Notebooks (outputs embedded), logs, caches
notebooks/
logs/
.cache/
.codegraph/

# Dead trees (kept for history; see pyproject coverage omit list)
scripts/_attic/
scripts/_oneoff/
scripts/xfp/archive/
scripts/xfp/research/
scripts/xfp/_research/
scripts/xfp/_attic/
